;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":192,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","user":"Yossarian","date":". 05-01-2014, 12:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-01T00:22:00-07:00","id":123004,"title":"","content":"Ooh! Let's fill this up <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> only read the opening fiction so far, will work my way through it all eventually.<br /> <br /> Opening fiction, 3rd subsection, column 3<br /> '...lest <b>his</b> lose his balance...'<br /> <br /> Opening fiction, pg4, 1st line<br /> '...God judges it <b>meet</b> to adjourn...'<br /> <br /> Opening fiction, pg4, 1st column, 3rd para<br /> '...<b>but did for once he did not mind</b>...'<br /> <br /> Opening fiction, 3rd subsection, 3rd column VS Opening fiction, pg3, 1st column, para 2<br /> The first one says the descent has only been a month, the second one though says there are issues with Washington because there has been no progress for month<b>s</b> plural. Either I'm misunderstanding the text or there's a number mismatch.<br /> <br /> More to come, but I'm at work right now, sneakily reading an intro fiction is the best I can do at the moment <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/291-scutarii","name":"Scutarii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-01T06:24:52-07:00","id":123099,"title":"","content":"Page 100, second column, continued paragraph reads &quot;In game terms, that means the Beast will reaping health levels from the victim amkhat...&quot; It should probably read, &quot;...means the Beast will <b>be</b> reaping health levels...&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-01T09:54:51-07:00","id":123248,"title":"","content":"P. 19: &quot;... set up around the D.C. Metro area <b>taxing </b>advantage of their proximity...&quot;<br /> Bit of a Freudian slip, that one, heh.",